  "rationale": "ConfigurationTyped is exactly an existential current environment whose empty-pending Realizes and SequenceTyped share the requested final environment; Realizes includes class-table well-formedness. Unpacking.Steps/Stuck reuse the extended machine, and StepsExactly's refl/step constructors count head transitions. Finishing remains code=[]. This matches the equation and all completion/stuck notation, with the distinction between changing current and fixed final environment explicit before the soundness results.",
  "limitations": [
    "Correspondence review compares prose, mathematics, definitions and theorem/example statements; Lean proof validity and command results are separate checks. Listing relevant source-context snapshots records definitions and assumptions consulted, not an audit of every tactic or unrelated declaration.",
